## Matched patterns

1. **FAILED**: The job jar /opt/flink/does-not-exist.jar does not exist (runtime)
   The JobManager exits at startup because spec.job.jarURI points at a file that is not in the image or was not downloaded. Kubernetes restarts it, so the pod is in CrashLoopBackOff.
   Next: Fix spec.job.jarURI, or build the jar into the image at that path.

